<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθεντ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>principal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					1.11.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>warranted, authentic,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρογραφία, ἀποχή, διαθήκη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				260.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.</u>
				1010
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				326ii 23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <i>original,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHamb.</u>
					18ii6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Leid.W.</u>
					9.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.25
			</span></i>; <i>authoritative,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				182
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς,</span>
			<i>loqui</i> make an <i>authoritative</i> statement, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				9.14.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ.</span>
			<i>nuntiabatur</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.9.1
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				<i>with higher authority,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					177
				</span></i>
			.</div>
